ith a positive pregnancy test at screening\"\n                    }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        \"right\": {\n          \"AND\": {\n            \"left\": {\n              \"OR\": {\n                \"left\": {\n                  \"raw text\": \"Females of child bearing potential not using acceptable method of birth control prior to or during study\"\n                },\n                \"right\": {\n                  \"OR\": {\n                    \"raw text\": \"Concern for inability of the patient to comply with study procedures and/or follow up (eg, alcohol or drug abuse)\"\n                    }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}"